#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88243e685301c4c606ae84409f255a51efce0e9f7cbfa80679a57aaae299497b
#. default-sha256: 3539594d77969d87e0f9781bf664855658493956e13246d7b08d681a0d34cbe2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫넬리의 말에 기가 죽었음에도 ⟪k:10⟫멜의 아마빛 눈"
"은 ⟪k:11⟫소녀를 찾아다녔습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6a496e4fc2aff5037f8c387c73174d481de63cb503d328ce2c441d8ff02b916
#. default-sha256: b7f189d34a6aabecb480f4c71c8c83d9221ab96e2cb0c6f18628ea810d1693f0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫우후후, ⟪k:1⟫이 지경이어서야 ⟪k:2⟫멜이 품은 감정이 무엇인지…… 자명하지 않은지요?"

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1ff61d3bc8d4440eda6b16f2a87eb59f677e9ea1951ef00fe566d1ef5e4c31
#. default-sha256: 6cf578c98ac01ba8f5bd5d294f8445ae6767b169cb9f87710fb56a659168447c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫멜 본인은 이 감정을 ⟪k:2⟫명확히 이해하지 못 했을 겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3b3905ffdc77cf919da7388bcc66fa750ed8b594b5ccce269a317f34ce59f2e
#. default-sha256: 35d3348439a50ceef802c4f8971d3eb0f40e8af1214bda710b7dee6f091b9ea8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫멜의 마음은 ⟪k:1⟫방향을 못 잡는 항로에 나선 것처럼 ⟪k:2⟫매우 불안정했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8eae34750ed5f6c9d8262205123e0925b5a15f0a922cf5af02f031728ba2da0a
#. default-sha256: 8a569ddbcea91c45152e8dd7a58bd2b797e6e6bf8e75fb9c0a7bf1d6b6d557ac
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런데도 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀를 본 순간에는 ⟪k:2⟫심장이 크게 뛰었습니다. ⟪k:3⟫그리고 온몸에 ⟪k:4⟫기"
"쁨과 불안이 드리웠지요……."

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fe7f7050d740a29d0f0af8d237e50a1155cdf81a8d5682b8c4b2c9a8a977ab6
#. default-sha256: b1c98abd084a5623c6563f2459e16de946cabadf5b762829fc9562fd64834a9f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜이 이런 감정에 빠진 건 ⟪k:1⟫난생 처음입니다. ⟪k:2⟫그래서 ⟪k:3⟫감정의 고삐를 쥐기도 ⟪k:4⟫쉽"
"지 않았을 겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69269f69c164c0963ddf03fc1554fb0eb756dd110014918fcae3cca13c5b071a
#. default-sha256: 2aa92a1ebbc1d69fb3119897ff1986436ac7c754c12aacd6915f350a22020d1d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫멜은 기회가 될 때마다 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀에게 말을 걸었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fdb72136e07ae2bf1baee5cbd43c78a36fc006f8d4fe84e586ed1beda8f22b3
#. default-sha256: 871abdf4ae15b39e676f1f0b6d6105757a66ade5afc2e92584caea7a4dec176b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫말을 못 거는 날에는 ⟪k:1⟫풀이 죽어서 입도 안 열거나, ⟪k:2⟫멍하니 지냈습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd18e0be29a3800590dfd5cf9a309f973800708d925b6030773ff99d1f1aed23
#. default-sha256: d83a3a1a00522db3860a3879921ae0c14eb46d6b71430a427adc2d86669a66c9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사랑이란 신기하지요……. ⟪k:1⟫사람을 바꿀 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫큰 영향력이 있으니까요."

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78b272b8b161fa8c1d28d4360a144c0d32c85ca20b565e37403ea117cae9174d
#. default-sha256: dceee93499292bb1682144d00ae5660c5b075fc4b4597cc410c4b0d69d35af59
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜의 언동은 ⟪k:1⟫역시 어색했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫말을 걸다 실패하지만 ⟪k:3⟫또 말을 거는…… 그런 걸 반"
"복했지요."

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adb08a9cdcaa33e7bbc5cf0aebb87314196bb1c8fc4a967eec6276ecd6e03c8c
#. default-sha256: d894426c192488f63d76ecc0b36d4664347a8820967cec3a7fdc220cc8e737cc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지금이라면 멜도 ⟪k:1⟫연애를 다룬 연극을 보고 ⟪k:2⟫오열하지 않을지요?"

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 172d0c06ff63cf1958cfbb5ec0a04d8f806f68abf0a650c8a27282945cd22bc5
#. default-sha256: bd0d25eaa075538d387e23741c043b251ef8c138f9cf501f8ad4a53381b63531
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫비극에 감명을 받는 이유는 ⟪k:1⟫본인의 인생과 대조하기 때문입니다. ⟪k:2⟫적어도 제 생각은 그렇"
"습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7361a6a89e907fe398938defd9386720827492d0b96e74af78269ac60fca651b
#. default-sha256: e37d77ec078c0c3a48fb39c855e318ef4147526ae7c2c133e961cd86e66f304a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사랑을 알아야 ⟪k:1⟫대연애 이야기에 공감이 실리지요……."

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b136cda6d06bf8cdef071d762a16b8ce97822ca0e1414b002c12072cdc0f7fcd
#. default-sha256: 08f6d20b22596a083043ef42cc92995388a46397da36131729119d4cc1a9bdd0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자…… 백발 소녀 본인은 ⟪k:1⟫멜의 태도에 ⟪k:2⟫당혹을 금치 못 했나 봅니다."

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7c2913ede8872d76fb07d3fe63f733f1bd859646c627556d558b6779096a2db
#. default-sha256: f1eeb1dad2e7d38c4931455cbebfb271749a951c1c1d36944fa2172b8f9e766c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀 입장에서도 ⟪k:1⟫사근사근 대해 주는 점은 반길 일이었을 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 기쁜 마음"
"보다도 ⟪k:3⟫동요를 느꼈지요."

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3e7a0a83fcd86113cb2066271d751bcb5ff13aaca628e8eb5ff68b3296d0f16
#. default-sha256: 2c3ad7b50450ea52f61da4f3e8b95048fea33a47a8dfa3a5d029a7a8dc9e096f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜의 말을 듣고, ⟪k:1⟫아마빛 시선을 받을 때, ⟪k:2⟫소녀는 어떡해야 할지 갈피를 못 잡는 것처럼 "
"보였습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3016dc815541a1a8e2443738f7cae7da6b22eb441b54841b4a316e3ff548fdd2
#. default-sha256: 5e43261c66b8e13e9fd049437faa40c673558b69a9187ae10ac859ba83da2a68
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 멜은 굴하지 않았습니다. ⟪k:1⟫멜 본인은 ⟪k:2⟫왜 이토록 열띤 감정이 ⟪k:3⟫솟구치는지 몰랐"
"을 겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d5cb3d564fd36b395a30aea0517ff800b5c5d972b58e40a03b359e0d689d5d3
#. default-sha256: 60815d43add927423a1ee182f96dcc777a79f56c3dd893600a027c64d4ed9a49
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫첫사랑이란 ⟪k:1⟫특히 ⟪k:2⟫맹렬히 타오르기 마련.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫주인님께서도 짚이는 바가 있지 않으신"
"지요?"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cdcb4320eed00c1938793cb6db8588d238251b4625a2f17c898d60b657fc19d
#. default-sha256: 7638a6cfe2236d73359b8605ef8d3712e991e5671a9ffd3d12a8dd298234ae27
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh? ⟪k:1⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머……, ⟪k:1⟫우후후."

#: scenario:scenario_A10B5545_1CA3_48D3_92E1_291FDC46E57E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1acb18bd701487fb04b66a348efda5a931c765f8a3320e79e8aa865c2bf52101
