msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(There she is. ⟪k:2⟫Is she cleaning?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No, it looks like she’s reading.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(그 애야. ⟪k:2⟫청소하는 건…… ⟪k:3⟫아니구나. ⟪k:4⟫책을 읽나?)"

#: scenario:scenario_A3BEDA6B_AC81_44AA_8E43_67485521CCCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 144501ac588336ab7e0bee5ef1528d3740ad1b68bbe66aa41a07b473ccd0d244
