#: scenario:scenario_1E811AC6_6801_426B_A54D_0CA525E34CCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccf1a569c0f9129f680c83a2252900ca8e3ddabfafe415db8101ae7e25579caf
