"⟪k:0⟫She was astonished, but she wrote him back anyway, taking care not to mention where she was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 놀랐지만, ⟪k:1⟫답장을 쓰기로 했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫본인이 어디에 있는지는 ⟪k:3⟫숨긴 채로요."

#: scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b38d1ad1d054b546e9b46925d63c0065739b7d3e6ae9b89aad00995763e7a1f
#. default-sha256: 154736b43c96b5e51e6c44a2f12fef7d004b35ffb3bf6cf93b2eafea4d797a18
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After having exchanged letters a number of times, the two felt very close to one another—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as though they had known each other for many years, despite having never met."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫둘은 편지를 몇 차례 주고받자, ⟪k:1⟫얼굴도 못 봤는데 ⟪k:2⟫옛날부터 알고 지내던 것처럼 친밀해졌"
"습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f95af225add3d8d453410aaaea824ddf91cc33a9b07b8748dbe0ec6ded5d648a
#. default-sha256: a52be805dc0a3f054cfd2acb1306c22ba3e8f7715037d7e604dee1b14ee20558
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And eventually, the man..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 마침내 ⟪k:1⟫남성은……"

#: scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b4417fb06856e750f10b46149dc0c51f0e16d780c1d2caa3f5d74a996173c64
#. default-sha256: 2db099bb4acb73452541082274e0a227d334c2dea7cb6c54c1ae6cb72c6d52d5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Said he wanted to meet her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫만나고 싶단 말을 꺼냈어?"

#: scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b30f5716bd2c8582a522398853e3a72517eed5776c232d4fed85352fb5dc8a5
#. default-sha256: b55b49ec73dde07fb9f524cee14601a8606a3060d1757356fe51c9fdaec12062
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Indeed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……네."

#: scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06f26138afea3fe0e29fb08b09467d0444046dde9d81423475bb8f90937bfa3d
#. default-sha256: 76dcf732864e7b6f70ad6c14151fc6824a67a63c00a201c8b7afba65fd8bfa57
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl was unsure what to do.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Should she tell him of how she lived?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Should she reveal where she spent her days?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 망설였습니다. ⟪k:1⟫본인의 처지를 말해야 할지. ⟪k:2⟫어디에 있는지 알려 줘야 할지."

#: scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f06b210a3e88ab5cfb4ef11f9840f83164574721e5e70d77e071d4f4868e8952
#. default-sha256: acc50351c331c7f53f60f7712a838e720d2f5bb0a13ae5bf6ad9be62d7cee55d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was afraid if she did, he would cease to send her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그걸 적어 보내면 ⟪k:1⟫그 사람은 편지를 더 안 보낼 수도 있습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0071af64e827c3b8ceac19ade49d4c32b451c7f7081ba4bfd2bc22acaf242b11
#. default-sha256: a2cf122460e9033456b26b6a97576ab167e5970643d10222520ef43670c7704b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was sure he believed her to be a young lady of noble blood..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫귀한 집 영애와 편지를 주고받는 건 줄⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫알고 있을 겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_5EF1B95C_1B1B_463B_9ABE_95212015F172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e0b077e8d48d1b28953e6dd1b47e7c4fc0aca452766337da00d4a65598901d9
#. default-sha256: d7d57f173a096faf139eb5e7b2b672306a83bfa44a56a2d31ddeabc864424a56
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5EF1B95C_1B1B_463B_9ABE_95212015F172"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and not a girl locked away in a house deep in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이렇게 ⟪k:1⟫유폐된 여자인 줄은 모를 겁니다……."

#: scenario:scenario_928C667F_86C1_4B66_ADEB_36C1B7B5ACE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3d499e1e2518daaf50c6f4abc9886df4e2f1f0911d6d4d1d138331c17f4a22a
#. default-sha256: 1ed2ca903f3299c6cc0bf865d44da1613ee3e02024b47c18d8f354b3c612bdaa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_928C667F_86C1_4B66_ADEB_36C1B7B5ACE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl could not bring herself to write a response.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She released the dove through "
"the window with nothing attached to its leg."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫답장을 쓰지 못 했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫비둘기의 발목에 아무것도 묶지 않고 ⟪k:3⟫창밖으로 내"
"보냈습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb6bdbaeff1368605481059fa36de8a7a875858a36da4e2028bc4854e5c75521
#. default-sha256: f1582443f7a861c078f323fd0bf7bb3e783faf6c61e561f520b260d5699e97a3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And yet, it returned with another letter, written in the man’s familiar hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러자 ⟪k:1⟫소녀가 답장을 하지 않았는데도 ⟪k:2⟫편지가 또 왔습니다. ⟪k:3⟫낯익은 남성의 필체로"
"――"

#: scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9565e1e235a6b75168bdcbf66aa6349816140441de8c4faccad2e1359d661032
#. default-sha256: 621e218b8668e8f5c8ec8b97b6897691baf97d499dca3e35c564a9f9c9fa0ccd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You must surely have a grave reason for your silence,” it said.⟪k:1⟫“I would like to know "
"that reason, and I would like to help you.⟪k:2⟫No matter what it may be, you have my word.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫너에게는 무슨 ⟪k:1⟫깊은 사정이 있구나. ⟪k:2⟫나는 그걸 알고 싶어. ⟪k:3⟫그리고 너를 돕고 싶어. "
"⟪k:4⟫그게 어떤 이유든 ⟪k:5⟫반드시."

#: scenario:scenario_4243FE58_99FC_4669_A108_6D091AF1DA94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7475ab77cef3303ef21b35a10876333b481b1cc9673576495e86c01a871bfce3
#. default-sha256: 966910c45ed09244326e188ec7cbe225034846e35ad2e41438f1b60f1c4ea303
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4243FE58_99FC_4669_A108_6D091AF1DA94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She deliberated.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though his letters were kind, she did not know this man.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"He was from the outside.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Would he still treat her the same way when he met her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……소녀는 망설였습니다. ⟪k:1⟫얼굴도 모르는 상대. ⟪k:2⟫문자는 몹시 부드럽지만 ⟪k:3⟫바깥 세계 사"
"람. ⟪k:4⟫내 모습을 봐도 좋게 대해 줄까?"

#: scenario:scenario_8F5608BB_5BDA_4C1A_902E_F3B51D02EDA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b718d0ac730098150010f747c58d25e095c5f7417eb2127a17f48a862ea07272
#. default-sha256: d0a8ef21323c4056f6b25e1d84ba97af4a896e09ec93e018c389dcb8abf3aef6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8F5608BB_5BDA_4C1A_902E_F3B51D02EDA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And did she even want to step out into the world beyond?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫나는 바깥 세계와 접하고 싶은 걸까?"

#: scenario:scenario_944EF2BA_DA9A_401C_A94E_33EF98DC569D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8392e78cdab1d175cd1c2b9c010020aa91f62eef1b4487000e45c30dbc46d90b
#. default-sha256: 57f83a56f20430decd648335794664d575099b4ac3d444f231f543707c26a483
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_944EF2BA_DA9A_401C_A94E_33EF98DC569D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you think she did?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는…… 어떻게 했을 것 같나요."

#: scenario:scenario_6BA85D26_61EC_4840_A811_4DC4ABA3B256
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7352f5a0dbedb546b50f7c31e25f056a7c5d4668640f7ef0fa6f60dbc199ba46
#. default-sha256: 215df04b722e6a2c9fea9c92f3c5eaba80d4ebb0f9e13e8988841a701e64beee
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA85D26_61EC_4840_A811_4DC4ABA3B256"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wrote a letter and agreed to meet him, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫편지를 써서 ⟪k:1⟫남자를 만나려 하지 않을까?"

#: scenario:scenario_FE34D9F5_4D42_4880_AD4E_25D719C40481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 981504bddef990681738a42bd16bd87af7d5e4ab4d33727d952935d9f66ecd76
#. default-sha256: dfa5104bf7a16979051c098765fd2fa67ba24574b7212adf269dfff0d274cd95
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE34D9F5_4D42_4880_AD4E_25D719C40481"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes... ⟪k:1⟫she did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네……, ⟪k:1⟫맞⟪k:2⟫아요."

#: scenario:scenario_B30F22CA_D1C1_45A7_841D_87806D358FFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46b75214f4bfbfadf6261a1488df728137f8830bb2579d97095ac09942a44637
#. default-sha256: 5335adde4a0d9ab11f30793b4e81d1b8942e93275aec3415ad69548fb383acec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B30F22CA_D1C1_45A7_841D_87806D358FFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl made up her mind: she would write a letter.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As always, when she tied it to "
"the dove’s leg, it flew off out the window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 편지를 쓰기로 했습니다. ⟪k:1⟫편지를 다리에 묶으니 ⟪k:2⟫비둘기가 여느 때처럼 날아갔습니"
"다."

#: scenario:scenario_3D794990_E54F_4FF5_9DBC_04872CCA9198
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4018046e3274fba16cc118cba600b294ec9f571651f8f293d9656dd4dcc18991
#. default-sha256: db99667bed3b1a9f92763eaf50ea07bb484b56690efd5f2d51951de0552a319b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D794990_E54F_4FF5_9DBC_04872CCA9198"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And for some time after that, she received no response from the man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 후로 시간이 지나도 ⟪k:1⟫남자는 답장을 보내지 않았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_848D3012_9678_4CFC_99BA_EDEC88106444
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bb4b084f29f0506958d64cf33d7fd19867de0186b28442fabd716e139b4c8d8
#. default-sha256: d8d5da0559779279d105bd7a86aa8424b4e55cdc5faf9da2436788c2e34782fc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_848D3012_9678_4CFC_99BA_EDEC88106444"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This saddened her, but she thought it was for the best.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She belonged in her own "
"confined world, her world of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 낙담했지만 ⟪k:1⟫이거면 되었다 쳤습니다. ⟪k:2⟫폐쇄된 어둠의 세계가 ⟪k:3⟫소녀가 살아갈 "
"세계니까요."

#: scenario:scenario_613CCC3A_D218_4D1E_98D4_DED85A7F0C8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 252ecb0bae45f7b5443c847b6ff65d1cf593bddb7281897b3021cd2ee998356d
#. default-sha256: ec98041318b97d3b24136027c0e4ab7d3cdfc719f9cf8c2b926b6707772efe54
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_613CCC3A_D218_4D1E_98D4_DED85A7F0C8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But then one day, light shone into the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데 ⟪k:1⟫어느 날, ⟪k:2⟫빛이 드리웠습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_67BBB3B7_1859_4B86_B245_05544EEF75D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7619defc6e80c61d9ab4f973ca42b00b6725ea76ee67046127afddb501a43152
#. default-sha256: 8fa1b3fc80c200b81a377803a2a43cfbe029d8b133df876acbc791a496da32fa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_67BBB3B7_1859_4B86_B245_05544EEF75D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The sealed door had been opened, and in the doorway stood a handsome "
"young man. ⟪k:5⟫“I have come for you,” he said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫열리지 않던 저택 문이 열리자, ⟪k:5⟫그곳에는 아름다운 남자가 있었습니다. "
"⟪k:6⟫남자는 말했습니다. ⟪k:7⟫데리러 ⟪k:8⟫왔다고요."

#: scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b5598efb23ce87e69289308ffcedf3dba3706d7287aba1626a2d797cde8e6ac
#. default-sha256: 19e51e231dd7ff29a3f26ca76eb2788d7467d829cf772faa68fcbb24b6655fc9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man was a prince from a neighboring kingdom. ⟪k:1⟫When the girl stepped outside, before "
"her sat a magnificent carriage—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the likes of which she had never before seen—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"accompanied by many servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 남자는 ⟪k:1⟫이웃 나라의 왕자님이었습니다. ⟪k:2⟫소녀가 밖에 나가니 ⟪k:3⟫난생 처음 보는 화려"
"한 마차와 많은 시종들이 있었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9b18dc5998a0929c5eee84f40d28cfc8b7247b088c2b7f2880afe50ec5c8ce4
#. default-sha256: a6c2f5576ef9286a636f4d9138604ef357be7075292098c76884f5f8698171fa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The prince, kind as in the letters, swore his love to her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왕자님은 소녀에게 변함없이 부드럽게 ⟪k:1⟫사랑을 맹세했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_EA4B82A1_1752_42A7_9AF9_2C915D3DBD06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c275accdd26d24551c6d31dca89950b18282055fe468a021258e7e4099bd208e
#. default-sha256: 9b6a315a41d8f4eb36fbc5aa4dd7ac6788a074346da39bcb0e94d3db4c5d64bb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA4B82A1_1752_42A7_9AF9_2C915D3DBD06"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And the two... ⟪k:2⟫lived happily ever after."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그리고 둘은…… 행복하게 살았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_74B45947_7027_4C4A_B4B8_C29E7B94E9D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 085a3edecfc7a31e77154ca773dcc0a249982a83ea63176b80148d116144107e
#. default-sha256: 58539477ca8ec3d505d4f3a29fbc5b12592c0f092f07b958f85ac325535b9a4f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_74B45947_7027_4C4A_B4B8_C29E7B94E9D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Ah, "
"what a nice story.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I’m glad it had a happy ending."
msgstr ""
